OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies kidnap and murder of
OL,4,A21-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied kidnapping and
OL,7,Fmurdering a 21-year-old who was found
OL,8,Fseriously injured in a car park.
OL,10,FEssex Police said Jack Sullivan was
OL,11,Ftaken from Waltham Abbey on 22 June. He
OL,12,Fwas found in a car park in Cheshunt,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, and taken to hospital
OL,14,Fwhere he died on 26 June.
OL,16,FKevhaunne Williams, 27, of Beechfield
OL,17,FWalk, Waltham Abbey, pleaded not guilty
OL,18,Fto both counts at Chelmsford Crown
OL,19,FCourt.
OL,21,FHe is scheduled to appear at the same
OL,22,Fcourt on 1 March.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
